            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ei baabaire baza yoona, omukono gwa MUKAMA gubarwanisa ku bakora kubi, nk'oku MUKAMA yaabaire yaabateisize naarahira; baareeba enaku nyingi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.15",
