        {
          "text": " mbone kurengyesa Abaisraeli amahanga ago, ndeebe ku baraabe nibaija kugyendera omu muhanda gwa MUKAMA, nk'oku baishenkurubo baabaire batwaza, nari shi batarikwija kutwaza batyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
